    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d656">

                <pb facs="0942" n="922" xml:id="pg922"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">795.00/10–1050</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1950-10-10">October 10, 1950</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Conversation With Mr. Lovett</hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Subject: Siberian Bombing</p>
                <p>The Pentagon has sent a very stiff message to General Stratemeyer directing a
                    report within 48 hours, which would be tomorrow night, and, in the event that
                    the bombing did take place, directing that the commanding officer responsible
                    should be removed. Mr. Lovett thinks well of further orders making clear our
                    original intention that ail our planes on operational missions should keep a
                    long way away from the border.</p>
            </div>
